  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-22" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Use this space to paste or type in any Important Changes During the Quarter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.61pt"&gt;Not Applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.61pt"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.61pt"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.61pt"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.61pt"&gt;Not Applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-23" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:5pt;text-indent:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Stateline Crude, LLC (the "Company") is subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&#8220;FERC&#8221;). These financial statements have been prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the FERC, as set forth in the applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America. We have condensed or omitted certain information or notes pursuant to FERC rules and regulation. Therefore, these financial statements should be read in conjunction with our Annual Report on FERC Form 6 for the year ended December 31, 2025, which includes a summary of significant accounting policies and disclosures. We have made normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of the financial results for the interim period presented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Statement of Cash Flow Adjustments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:5pt;text-indent:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;As of March 31, 2026, the Company has adjusted the following previously reported balances on page 120 of the financial statement:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:5pt"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:5.894%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:45.179%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:13.185%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.734%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:13.185%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.734%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:13.189%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height:14pt"&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" rowspan="2" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Line No.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="15" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Previous Quarter/Year Amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height:14pt"&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-